      Q. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلْوَدَ</span></b>  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, kept,</i> or <i>clave, to his,</i>
or <i>its, place, and could not be moved by any one;</i>
(L, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِعْلَوَّدَ</span></b> . (L. [See also 1.])

